- `Solve(words []string, puzzle []string) (map[string][2][2]int, error)`
- For each word, find the first and last positions. The expected coordinates are `[col, row]` — note the format: `{{0, 0}, {6, 0}}` for "clojure" at row 0 of "clojurermt": c is at (0,0), e is at (6,0). So the coordinate format is [x, y] = [column, row].
